// ----  Super Widescreeen (TKBS): Info ----
// * Super Widescreen = A combination of the following widescreen patches "Widescreen 1" && "Widescreen 2" && camera adjust

// 1. Snake356_fix: old ws that fixed an unknown creators, ported tto PAL 2003 by TKBS.
// 2. DanielS & PeterD's ws patches: only 1 line needed, documented & camera adjust added by TKBS.
