//* Use Cheat Engine ".ct" file For All garages, heli-pads, boat moorings, street parking, car parks, emergency VH locations etc

// ---- [Garage Editor Explained]; ----
//* Colours 	0-94	||	00-5E - see colors.dat
//* Vehicles	130-236	||	82-EC - see default.ide

// Ocean Beach - "GARAGE"
//Line 1	=	VH ID 1
//Line 2	=	X
//Line 3	=	Y
//Line 4	=	Z
//Line 5	=	H
//Line 6	=	Spawn Time or allow colours
//Line 7	=	Immediate Spawn 00000010
//Line 8	=	0000001F = DMG PROOF
//Line 9	=	Colours 1 & 2 || FF014E44
//	Line 9a	=	Colours 1 || FF01|4E|44
//	Line 9b	=	Colours 2 || FFFF01|4E
//Line 10	=	//Make available  000000FF || 0001FFFF when just taken, set back to 0000FFFF to spawn again.

// Hyman Condo - "HELI-PAD"
//Line 1	=	VH ID 1
//Line 2	=	X
//Line 3	=	Y
//Line 4	=	Z
//Line 5	=	00000000 = UNKNOWN
//Line 6	=	FFFFFFFF = UNKNOWN		| Possibly (-1, -1)
//Line 7	=	00000010 = Immediate Spawn
//Line 8	=	27010000 = UNKNOWN  - Possibly change of locked, i.e. always unlocked ?
//Line 9	=	041E8EA6 = UNKNOWN	- Colours ? -- or -- Spawn Timers ? Related to Immediate Spawn ?
//Line 10	=	00000719 = UNKNOWN	- Colours ? -- or -- Spawn Timers ? Related to Immediate Spawn ?
//Line 11	=	0000FFFF = //Make available  || 0001FFFF when just taken, set back to FFFF to spawn again.

